{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-ST-3", "avgTag": "幕間", "storyName": "無法再一次踏入的河", "storyInfo": "完成了任務的緹緹回到了薩爾貢。而在米諾斯，重建第一神殿僅僅只是個開始……\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g10_templegarden", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，這是需要定期服用的藥物和抑制劑，我都從羅德島辦事處帶過來了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽說理事官辦公室已經取消了對贊索斯師徒的囚禁命令，也不打算追究你協助他們逃獄的事。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。我後來才知道，里底婭小姐早就猜到了我們的計劃，當時就給我大開方便之門，事後自然也不會追究。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使如此，你們也還是打算離開雅賽努斯，去其他地方遊歷？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "待在這裡只會讓我的老同學胡思亂想，還不如出去走走，跟更多的人交談，做更多的事。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？很少見你如此坦誠啊，呂刻伊昂。要是你當我的病人的時候能這麼老實，我就不需要派三名羅德島幹員盯著你了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，之前給您添麻煩了……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來贊索斯先生在第一神殿的行為，給你帶來了不小的影響。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼樣？要不要直接承認礦石病根本不會隔絕英雄氣概，向我投降認輸？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "做夢。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘖，嘴巴跟石頭一樣硬。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "快點出發吧，再晚的話就趕不上渡口的船了，代理的擺渡人沒有贊索斯先生那麼好心，如果遲到了，他不會等你們的。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "糟了，呂刻伊昂，我們快走……"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "多謝萊娜小姐的藥，我們以後再見！"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral", "volume": 0.9}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#15$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎，不要從草坪那邊走啊，我剛整理完——", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#15$2"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "算了，這兩個年輕人的破壞力怎麼可能比幾十隻馱獸還厲害呢？"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "萊娜", "content": "牠們踩壞的花卉和草皮都還沒清理呢，可惜了那些淡藍色的波羅尼……"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "musicvolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.3, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_courtyard", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗚……嗚……", "name": "小里底婭"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別哭了，里底婭……", "name": "小萊娜"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果有一天你和施特羅斯伯伯住的地方，也像我原來的家那樣，被別人砸壞了……", "name": "小里底婭"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我和你就都沒有家可以回去了，這該怎麼辦……", "name": "小里底婭"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧，就算沒有這幢房子，就算我們走散了，我也絕對不會丟下你的！", "name": "小萊娜"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對了！如果你離家太遠，擔心自己找不到回家的路，那你就找這片花圃。", "name": "小萊娜"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "花……花圃……？", "name": "小里底婭"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，我會在裡面種滿淡藍色的波羅尼，你只要看到它們，就知道自己回家了。", "name": "小萊娜"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "同樣的，如果你先找到了路，你也用同樣的辦法為我指路，好嗎？", "name": "小萊娜"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好……萊娜姐姐，我們說定了……", "name": "小里底婭"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g10_templegarden", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "musicvolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "公共花園的草坪曾經種滿花朵和香草，如今只剩下馱獸群踩出的凌亂腳印。"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，即使花園暫時失去往日絢爛迷人的風貌，留下一片狼藉，那些藍色的花瓣依舊在這片土地裡。"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這麼一大片淡藍色的波羅尼……你也在懷念從前，不是嗎？", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝你，里底婭。我回家了。", "name": "萊娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，我來送今年分的蘋果了！", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "留給神殿當供品的那份已經送到樓下的倉庫裡了，這些是我特地留下來的，讓您和神殿的大家嚐嚐鮮。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝，每年都麻煩您費心。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們能順利收穫，都仰賴雅賽努斯的大家幫助，還有神殿的協調安排，是我該說麻煩您了才對。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您今天的精神不錯。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿，我們果農關心的就是收成，豐收能給人帶來滿足嘛。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，我們神殿關心的則是大家的精神，豐收確實是其中很重要的一環。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$2"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那以後還要繼續麻煩您了！我就先不打擾啦，接下來就得迎接石榴的收穫季，今天還有不少修剪枝條的工作還沒做完呢。", "name": "果農代表"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2086_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_dooropen", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蘋果芬芳，陽光明亮，多麼美好的一天！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "第一神殿的儀式順利完成，雅賽努斯迎來豐收，你照拂的擺渡人先生也振作了起來。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "關心大家精神的祭司啊，明明一切都好，聰慧的你為何還如此憂心忡忡？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我擔心的是你。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我？為什麼？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這幾天，我一直在想你當初回到雅賽努斯時說的話。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$2"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說你在夢中看到了米諾斯的起點，看到了克瑞斯拉與她的第一神殿。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$2"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你也說你思考了許多，關於米諾斯的曾經和未來，關於你自己的目標和方向。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$2"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一切都是讓你回來的緣由。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這幾天發生的事，似乎印證了我對這個神諭的解讀，那不是什麼花團錦簇的美好未來，不安始終在我心中縈繞不散。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "神諭只是一種英雄的精神指引給我們的方向，它未必會成真，這一點我們在祭司學院裡早就學過。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "普通的神諭確實如此，但……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "比如說，我當然希望豎琴能夠回歸，但它以那樣奇妙的方式回到了第一神殿，讓一切顯得似乎都是注定，無法更改……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不如換個角度去想吧，聰慧的祭司小姐，雖然終點確實是豎琴的回歸，但它回歸的過程如此奇妙，或許我的神諭也會如此。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也可能你的解讀並不是終點，它只是過程中的艱難一幕，終點則還在別處。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……希望如此吧。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，這幾天來發生的事，也印證了我的想法。我確實應該回來，米諾斯需要我，我也需要回到這片土地。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你卻仍不願接手如今已基本建成的第一神殿。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是因為身為感染者，你擔心自己擔任祭司會有阻力……？但贊索斯已將他在神殿廣場上看到的幻象都告訴了我，我以為你已經不再介意。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傳統是可以改變的，你說得對。我也可以在議事廳為你發起投票……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，只是因為我當初提議重建第一神殿，為的本來就不是讓自己成為管理它的祭司。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想要的是凝聚我們的精神，不僅是雅賽努斯人，還有其他城邦、其他米諾斯人……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "總之，聽說拉刻代蒙與科林尼亞的變化也很大，我想去看看。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你果然是來找我辭行的。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也沒那麼快啦，我還是會跟大家一起努力直到第一神殿正式完工。坎提亞已經在籌備徹底完工後的慶祝酒會了，我也不會錯過的！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#3$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你還是像從前那樣隨心所欲。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$2"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感謝您的盛情招待，讓我看到了一場意料之外的好戲。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "眼下雅賽努斯即將按照預定的航道出發，我們也該動身離開了。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的計劃仍不夠周詳，出現了一些變數，讓您見笑了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說到這一點，恕我冒昧，有一個問題我很好奇。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雅賽努斯的那位擺渡人先生在神殿的廣場上公然指控您與薩爾貢人之間有交易，昨日您也被緊急召去議事廳述職。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但現在，您安然出現在這間辦公室裡——莫非您有什麼特殊的自保底牌？還是此事另有隱情？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也不算是什麼隱情，只是我原本就為此事的後續處理做了一些布置，議事廳瞭解後充分信任了我的執政能力。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於詳細是怎樣的布置，因為是尚未發生的事，恐怕我就不便多說了。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們只需要知道，您依然是雅賽努斯城的理事官。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。我也依然掌握著安排、調度雅賽努斯重大事務的權力。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您這麼說我就放心了——我在這裡鄭重地向您提出一項建議。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩位想必非常清楚，如今的米諾斯正在發生劇烈的變化。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雅賽努斯自不必說，在拉刻代蒙，新的競技場也拔地而起，做好了迎接各國競技選手的準備。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然里底婭理事官或許不愛聽到“傳統”二字，但兩位不覺得，現在正是回歸傳統的時候嗎？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這片大地正處在持續不斷的變動之中，不如就讓我們暫時放下三城之間的競爭與傾軋，回歸往日的聯合城邦，重啟古老的盛典？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "分散在各地的村鎮與小城邦必將響應，我們的力量也會日漸壯大。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論是要重鑄米諾斯的榮光，還是讓聖火傳遍這片大地……這都將是最好的機會。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩位意下如何？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這就是您這幾天來一直在雅賽努斯東聞西嗅的理由？您在考察我們。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是一些改不掉的商人秉性罷了，總得先做點市場調查嘛。若是冒犯了您，我可以向您道歉。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您真擅長製造意外，這項提議恐怕我沒辦法直接答覆您。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無妨，您確實也該鄭重。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉刻代蒙的祭司西妮斯卡小姐，您意下如何呢？", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉刻代蒙的行政事務不是由我一個人就能決定的。不過，有一點我可以肯定——", "name": "西妮斯卡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉刻代蒙絕不會拒絕任何挑戰。", "name": "西妮斯卡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g1_rivercrossing", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$warm_intro", "key": "$warm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我送你渡河，然後你就該直接回薩爾貢了。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "嗚哇，感覺自己像個被押送離境的犯人——"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "開個玩笑。"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已瞭解你對米諾斯的心意，但你畢竟是薩爾貢人，梅捷緹克緹小姐。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說實話，我依然無法忍受薩爾貢人的雙腳踩在我們米諾斯的土地上。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我明白的，我理解您。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這幾天我也一直在想，到底還有什麼事，是我能夠為米諾斯、為我的父輩們曾經犯下的錯而做的。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "我想過是不是該把三城建造的工程師手記留下來，只帶著建造圖紙回去——"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "誰讓帕夏當初跟我說的交換條件，要的就只是“圖紙”。"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我仔細想了想，又覺得這樣不夠——這只是一種逃避責任、騙自己心安的折衷手段，因此它遠遠不夠。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我就應該把它們帶回去，放在我的博物館裡，讓所有薩爾貢人都能親眼見證，他們的歷史書上寫的全是謊言。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的帕夏不會高興的。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有什麼關係呢？我們家本來就不擅長讓帕夏高興。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，昨天我見了你們的理事官，那位能幹的沃爾珀小姐。我那時才知道，原來她早就做了準備。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她讓學者整理並影印了整份記錄，還寫了論文，等我把資料帶回去，完成了交換，就在哥倫比亞的學術刊物上以特刊的形式發表。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她來找我是想讓我在那份特刊上，以一個薩爾貢人的身分寫導讀，為論文資料的真實性背書……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再讓我用當初留學時的人脈，邀請更多的資深人士來一同研究這份珍貴的史料。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_proud", "layer": 1.0, "flip": 1.0, "x": 160.0, "y": 165.0}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她還說，可以為此專門給我頒發一個“榮譽米諾斯人”的勛章！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#8$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我欽佩你的勇氣。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還好吧，就當作是替我父親做一點他做不到的事。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，我在雅賽努斯也過得很愉快啊。昨天我還去見了恩底彌翁神殿的那位祭司小姐，她說我們在舞台上看到的幻象也是一種神諭！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一直以為米諾斯人的神諭只存在於夢中——書裡是這麼說的。聽她這樣說，我嚇了一跳。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幻象、幻聽、夢境都可能是神諭，夢是神諭的情況比較多一點，因為夢是我們與逝者和英雄的精神進行交流的重要途徑。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "祭司小姐也是這麼說的。我把我在舞台上看到的，還有我之前在馱獸牧場做的夢都告訴她了，她還幫我分析了很久。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最後她用那種很神秘的語氣說：“梅捷緹克緹小姐，您現在或許不信，但我認為，您的神諭預示著您終有一日能當上帕夏。”", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼分析出來的啊！她是不是在騙我？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我現在也算榮譽米諾斯人了，恩底彌翁的祭司幫我解讀的神諭，我是真的會相信的哦。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你可以相信。神諭只是一種生活的指引，你相信它，它就能為你帶來力量。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "假如薩爾貢的邊境上能有像你這樣的帕夏，那我們之間很多流血的悲劇或許就不會發生。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "唔，我大概明白了。"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "緹緹", "content": "那我姑且就把她的這些話當作是我未來可能要背負的一種責任——我會努力的。"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_churchbell", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這響徹全城的聲音……是有公投嗎？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "送你過河之後，我要回去接受一場雅賽努斯全城的公投。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雅賽努斯的所有公民將會就我這幾天的所作所為做出評判，公投的結果將決定我是否能留在這座城市。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但您明明是為了米諾斯——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 299, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論為了什麼，我的所作所為都必須接受審判，這是我為自己的行為所應承擔的責任。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1"}, {"id": 301, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$1"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "時候不早了。走吧，梅捷緹克緹小姐。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "musicvolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.3, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在那幻象中又見到了伊薩科斯，還有故鄉的河。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那條河，它還是你夢中染血的模樣嗎？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1"}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，它就像我記憶中那樣，恬靜、溫柔，不那麼清澈，卻承載著哺育大地的泥沙與生機。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多美的神諭。這樣一來，無論你今後在哪裡，應該都能夠重新拿起詩集了。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……是啊。", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk", "volume": 1.0, "loop": "true", "channel": "o"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "o", "fadetime": 2.5}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "musicvolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.6, "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無論這場公投的結果如何，無論他留在還是離開雅賽努斯，贊索斯都能平靜地接受。"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他緩步朝著神殿廣場走去。"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三個月後"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "53_g8_sargondeluxeroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_avg_dailylifeofsargon_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper2", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看看這封拉特蘭寄來的學者信件——“非常震撼，歷史學就是在不斷排除謬誤中尋找真相，貴國的勇氣令人欽佩”。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有哥倫比亞的日報報導——“正視了歷史，體現出薩爾貢的大國責任”。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 368, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就為了減輕你從米諾斯回來後立即舉辦的特展造成的不良影響，我現在每天都得動用個人關係，儘量幫你收拾殘局！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹小姐，希望你能明白，你這種自作主張的做法，只能奏效一次。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若是再有類似情況，那你就可以考慮自己從法爾賈萬達巴德博物館的館長一職卸任之後該如何謀生了。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 373, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_question", "layer": 1.0, "x": 270.0, "y": 165.0}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是您的意思，還是帕夏的意思？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有什麼區別嗎？我的意思就是帕夏的意思。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我本以為，我們離開米諾斯的時候已經協商好了——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次文物交換與米諾斯親善的任務能圓滿完成，都歸功於您的帶領，相應地，您要負責向帕夏解釋相關的情況。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於怎麼說、說多少，那全看您，只要您能讓帕夏滿意就行。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 382, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這次的文物交換任務本來就是在我的帶領下完成的！而且，我怎麼知道你竟然膽大包天到這個地步……！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別以為這次我幫你糊弄過去就沒事了，不會再有下一次。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，我必須提前警告你——此事的影響極大，我的人脈甚至告訴我，黃金城已派出使者，對方即將到訪米納特哈瑪儀。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要求你從今往後謹言慎行。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 388, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2"}, {"id": 390, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_open_door", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_slbell", "volume": 1.0, "delay": 1.2}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到我人還沒到，我動身的消息就已經傳到了。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1"}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您……這絢爛的儀表、輕盈的姿態，您一定就是萬王之王的使者吧！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 402, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您能駕臨，真是令我們這座小小的博物館蓬蓽生輝，請問您是來參觀的嗎？", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1"}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如果想去參觀那個米諾斯的新特展，我可以……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不需要你！我來為尊貴的使者大人講解就好。", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1"}, {"id": 408, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1487_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "參觀的事不急。我來主要是為萬王之王傳達一道他親授的旨意。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#12$1"}, {"id": 410, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下在黃金城也聽說了這次米納特哈瑪儀派人出使米諾斯的事，他對此很有興趣。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#12$1"}, {"id": 411, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……！！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 413, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您……您是來接我的？我……榮幸之至！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#4$1"}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的家族在當地十分顯赫，我本人也一直渴望能有前往黃金城為萬王之王效忠的機會，我就知道總有一天我可以……", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#2$1"}, {"id": 416, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1487_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉了，這位聒噪的先生，我要找的不是您。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#2$1"}, {"id": 418, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹-娜蘇圖-瑪夏耶爾小姐，陛下希望您親赴黃金城，為他講述您在米諾斯的經歷。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1"}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "煩請開始為動身做準備吧，您在米諾斯的所作所為與所見所聞，陛下都很想聽一聽。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1487_1#1$1"}, {"id": 421, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_emoji_kira", "layer": 1.0, "y": 150.0}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 424, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 428, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}